      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "두둥실 떠오른 다음\n단숨에 급강하해서 공격한다.\n상대를 풀죽게 만들 때가 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "輕飄飄地浮起，\n然後急速墜落，進行攻擊。\n有時會讓對手畏縮。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pikachu prend de la hauteur avant de fondre sur\nson adversaire. Peut aussi apeurer l’ennemi.",
